      <description>一、Python 文件操作 1.1 文件打开函数 image-20230601114448402image-20230601114737895f = open(&amp;#39;D:/name.txt&amp;#39;, &amp;#39;w&amp;#39;, encoding=&amp;#34;UTF-8&amp;#34;) 执行后，会在D盘生成一个新文件name.txt。
1.2 文件内容读取 image-20230601141828793#1、读取所有内容,read(num),num指定读取字节长度 f = open(&amp;#39;D:/name.txt&amp;#39;, &amp;#39;r&amp;#39;, encoding=&amp;#34;UTF-8&amp;#34;) print(f.read()) #2、读取所有对象，以行为单位，放在数组中 f = open(&amp;#39;D:/name.txt&amp;#39;, &amp;#39;r&amp;#39;, encoding=&amp;#34;UTF-8&amp;#34;) print(f.readlines()) #3、每次读取一行，以下代码，分别读取第一行和第二行 f = open(&amp;#39;D:/name.txt&amp;#39;, &amp;#39;r&amp;#39;, encoding=&amp;#34;UTF-8&amp;#34;) print(f.readline()) print(f.readline()) #4、for 循环读取，每次读取一行 f = open(&amp;#39;D:/name.txt&amp;#39;, &amp;#39;r&amp;#39;, encoding=&amp;#34;UTF-8&amp;#34;) #print(f.read()) for i in f: print(f&amp;#34;每行数据为：{i}&amp;#34;) 1.3 文件关闭 #主动关闭文件占用 f = open(&amp;#39;D:/name.txt&amp;#39;, &amp;#39;r&amp;#39;, encoding=&amp;#34;UTF-8&amp;#34;) for i in f: print(f&amp;#34;每行数据为：{i}&amp;#34;) f.close() 方式二：with open语法（自动关闭文件）
with open(&amp;#39;D:/name.txt&amp;#39;, &amp;#39;r&amp;#39;, encoding=&amp;#34;UTF-8&amp;#34;) as f: for i in f: print(f&amp;#34;每行数据为：{i}&amp;#34;) 1.</description>
    </item>
    
